tures I have from last week, please?\", \"Would you mind showing me my most recent journal entry?\", \"Could you tell me what paperwork I keep in House, please?\", \"Finally, would you let me know which of my tasks I haven't done yet?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w25-0013\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please show me the files I've starred?\", \"Would you mind starring all of those, please?\", \"On another matter, could you show me my recently written diary entries, please?\", \"Could you narrow that down to just the ones from last weekend, please?\", \"Lastly, could you tell me how next monday looks for me?\"], [\"I'm tidying up my documents and want to see what I flagged as important, so can you pull up my starred files?\", \"Ah, good, I'd like to keep all of those handy, so can you just go ahead and star every one of them?\", \"Separate thing, I've been meaning to reflect on how things have gone, so can you show me what I've written in my diary recently?\", \"Hmm, the weekend was the rough bit, so can you just show me the ones from last weekend?\", \"One more thing, I'm trying to plan ahead a bit, so how does next monday look for me?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w25-0014\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you email Anneliese the, uh, the router password?\", \"ok, different thing, what did I write in my journal last weekend?\", \"oh and can you, um, settle up everything between me and Varir?\", \"so what, uh, what photos have I got from recently?\", \"oh wait, the studio door code is 74793, can you, um, keep that in the locker?\"], [\"can u email Anneliese the router password\", \"what did i put in my journal last weekend\", \"clear whatever's owed between me and Varir pls\", \"any pics from recently?\", \"studio door code is 74793, save it in the locker pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w25-0015\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please show me the photos from May?\", \"Would you mind deleting the fifth one, please?\", \"Oh dear, I didn't mean to do that. Could you please undo it?\", \"Separately, could you tell me how many notes